{"4679480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The First Chip", "steam_appid": 4679480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679480/extras/a5ecc15443a7557fa51668b577851cb8.avif?t=1780320920\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start broke. End owning the casino.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got scammed at a fair. Now it’s your turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an illegal gambling empire from nothing, rig machines, outplay customers, and climb your way to total control. Push your luck, bend the rules, and see how far you can go before everything collapses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679480/extras/9405d13aafac684182a1f9609dbfc4df.avif?t=1780320920\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your empire from the ground up</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a tiny stand </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn your first money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand into bigger and riskier operations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every upgrade brings more profit… and more danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679480/extras/b687640c27d64b7e3d38fb8dc6cdaaed.avif?t=1780320920\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cheat the system</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rig machines to maximize income</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate odds in your favor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take risks to earn faster</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful — the more you push, the harder the fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679480/extras/3eba1aa1211da7d346e30dd8cda7c5ea.avif?t=1780320920\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Outsmart everyone </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers aren’t just numbers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They react</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They adapt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can catch on</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay one step ahead… or lose everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no single strategy:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play safe and grow slowly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go all-in and risk it all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your own path to the top</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same destination. Completely different journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an illegal gambling empire from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk vs reward gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic systems and reactive world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ways to grow your business</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decisions that shape your run</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4679480/extras/a5ecc15443a7557fa51668b577851cb8.avif?t=1780320920\" width=780 height=440 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Start broke. End owning the casino.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got scammed at a fair. Now it’s your turn